<p>{{ salutation(gender, first_name, last_name) }},</p>
<p>thank you for your time today. Your hardware order <strong>{{ sr_number }}</strong> was completed on {{ completed_at | datetime }}. The handover protocol is attached as a PDF.</p>
{% if delivered %}
<p style="margin-bottom:4px;"><strong>Delivered</strong></p>
<ul style="margin-top:0;">
{% for d in delivered %}  <li>{{ d.article }} &middot; {{ d.asset_tag }}</li>
{% endfor %}</ul>
{% endif %}
{% if collected %}
<p style="margin-bottom:4px;"><strong>Collected</strong></p>
<ul style="margin-top:0;">
{% for c in collected %}  <li>{{ c.model }} &middot; {{ c.asset_tag }}</li>
{% endfor %}</ul>
{% endif %}
{% if deviation %}
<p><strong>Note from the visit:</strong> {{ deviation.code }} &middot; {{ deviation.label }}</p>
{% endif %}
<p>Recipient: {{ recipient_name }} &middot; Technician: {{ technician_name }}</p>
<p>Please keep the protocol for your records. If anything is missing, reply to this mail and mention {{ sr_number }}.</p>
